    "text": {
      "fields": [
        {
          "id": "text-promise-main",
          "kind": "title",
          "startWU": 0,
          "focusWU": 0.35,
          "endWU": 0.7,
          "publishable": true,
          "presentation": {
            "layout": "opener"
          },
          "movement": "spatial",
          "preset": "opener-v1",
          "titleStyle": "display",
          "text": "About Me",
          "description": "Hi, I’m Alex. I’m a designer at heart, and I love what I do."
        },
        {
          "id": "text-complexity-idea",
          "kind": "title",
          "startWU": 1.3,
          "focusWU": 1.7,
          "endWU": 2.1,
          "publishable": true,
          "presentation": {
            "layout": "center"
          },
          "movement": "spatial",
          "preset": "travelling-title-v1",
          "titleStyle": "standard",
          "text": "I’ve always been fascinated by complex problems…"
        },
        {
          "id": "text-complexity-conditions",
          "kind": "title",
          "startWU": 2.42,
          "focusWU": 2.82,
          "endWU": 3.22,
          "publishable": true,
          "presentation": {
            "layout": "center"
          },
          "movement": "spatial",
          "preset": "travelling-title-v1",
          "titleStyle": "standard",
          "text": "…especially those that require multidisciplinary thinking."
        },
        {
          "id": "text-background-unit",
          "kind": "scroll-block",
          "startWU": 3.465,
          "focusWU": 3.945,
          "endWU": 6.215,
          "publishable": true,
          "presentation": {
            "layout": "reading"
          },
          "block": {
            "id": "background-unit",
            "kind": "stack",
            "moduleGapRem": 4.6,
            "modules": [
              {
                "id": "context",
                "kind": "prose",
                "text": "You might be wondering what I mean by a complex problem. It can be identity technology, a financial product or something as ordinary as a keyboard. The scale changes. I enjoy finding out what sits behind the surface. Sometimes that means explaining it better. Sometimes it means inventing a different way of using it."
              },
              {
                "id": "education",
                "kind": "prose",
                "text": "I started my career 13 years ago in visual communication, after changing course from Computer Science to Communication Design in Mainz. Technology interested me, but I kept coming back to the effect an image, a word or a piece of motion can have on someone. It can explain an idea and change how the person receiving it feels about it. I still find that fascinating."
              },
              {
                "id": "practice",
                "kind": "prose",
                "text": "My work gradually became more digital. At Denaline I found myself becoming the digital specialist, working on interfaces, icon systems and motion, often alongside developers. Moving to London to join Yoti made the questions more serious. Identity technology had to work properly, of course, and people also had to understand why they should trust it. That was when product, brand and communication stopped feeling like separate jobs to me."
              },
              {
                "id": "selected-clients",
                "kind": "logo-grid",
                "label": "Selected work from across my career.",
                "items": [
                  {
                    "id": "yoti",
                    "label": "Yoti",
                    "src": "/images/about/client-logos/yoti.png",
                    "alt": "Yoti"
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "sp-global",
                    "label": "S&P Global",
                    "src": "/images/about/client-logos/sp-global.svg",
                    "alt": "S&P Global"
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "bentley",
                    "label": "Bentley",
                    "src": "/images/about/client-logos/bentley.svg",
                    "alt": "Bentley"
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "sunexpress",
                    "label": "SunExpress",
                    "src": "/images/about/client-logos/sunexpress.svg",
                    "alt": "SunExpress"
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "mccann",
                    "label": "McCann",
                    "src": "/images/about/client-logos/mccann.svg",
                    "alt": "McCann Worldgroup"
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "american-heart-association",
